{
  "schema": "research-public-artifact/v1",
  "concept": "Hidden indexes as a safe drop trial",
  "slug": "hidden-indexes-as-a-safe-drop-trial",
  "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e5f146a6c03ef428255a25d2010e29f0b9c408ea191bf06aad6dcfc3dd3ff9f3",
  "canonical_artifact_sha256": "ab97ed7aab81906a9f563f8a2b7e18d8c804dcb895dfbb238fc3be3e90746809",
  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "clm:604d2204038e9fd1845b0f03dfc975165fde06bd0707c362358d0d9f40af3f2c",
      "text": "Because MongoDB maintains a hidden index, unhiding makes it immediately available for query planning without rebuilding it. Availability does not imply the planner will necessarily select it. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-hidden.md",
      "also": [
        "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/method/db.collection.hideIndex.md",
        "https://www.percona.com/blog/new-in-mongodb-4-4-hidden-index/",
        "https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/DRIVERS-816",
        "https://studio3t.com/knowledge-base/3t-build/desktop-ide/mongodb-index-strategy/"
      ],
      "validation_status": "NOT-SAMPLED",
      "evidence_ids": []
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:4ca3db87b0b968f7ceb88c506b2878482c43b5f53ed5a6b2aa3911274818099b",
      "text": "Use db.collection.hideIndex(indexName) and db.collection.unhideIndex(indexName) for the trial and rollback. Inspect db.collection.getIndexes() to verify hidden:true; the hidden field is omitted when the index is unhidden. (medium confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-hidden.md",
      "also": [
        "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/method/db.collection.hideIndex.md"
      ],
      "validation_status": "NOT-SAMPLED",
      "evidence_ids": []
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:535ec4afbea0fa2133c7d9b28f0a8498f0a5152dc7d138c9a8723ca060a7cdd3",
      "text": "Use db.collection.hideIndex(\"index_name\") to hide an existing index and db.collection.unhideIndex(\"index_name\") to restore planner eligibility; hideIndex is a mongosh wrapper around collMod with index.hidden. Verify the hidden flag with getIndexes(). (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-hidden.md",
      "also": [
        "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/method/db.collection.hideIndex.md",
        "https://www.percona.com/blog/new-in-mongodb-4-4-hidden-index/"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:0ef57b2574205aaa3f978e3f89f9876fa1a18672d3bb01e8ebfc6a40e43b16ed",
        "ev:6475c3df8a6ee03f13d871b213d3ec2f0b97c63a1664639b5d3f44a8ed6ee800",
        "ev:a4ac3746bb9addce1d494fc3a139fb0c5be0025dcb16d290bb41a67eeb4c2066"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:30e57f3ee3260dffbb4efc15596cabaf0e696ccef305f86d963a15a3ca24a15c",
      "text": "Hiding preserves unique constraints and TTL expiration. Consequently, a successful query-performance trial cannot establish the consequences of removing these enforcement or expiration behaviors. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-hidden.md",
      "also": [
        "https://www.percona.com/blog/new-in-mongodb-4-4-hidden-index/",
        "https://studio3t.com/knowledge-base/3t-build/desktop-ide/mongodb-index-strategy/",
        "https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/DRIVERS-816"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:ed8fa365ce8ed53a451f1cd5700ca5da6c5ecff87249f377ba3d39af8386470c"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:4b4ca35f96d0d9451ef4431a0cc56e7ab8482d016f4fa24863e77390162df871",
      "text": "Queries cannot use cursor.hint() to select a hidden index; operations that hint it return an exception. Check application hints before hiding a candidate index. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-hidden.md",
      "also": [
        "https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/DRIVERS-816"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:67d50bbf056059d6f5e37c864f2f277b53dcd152779a30beba52e4d21bb49bf8",
        "ev:ff89e0933d023b2acfa0941fa2ac011b293bc64d5a2db0b95771a66b258df326"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:f81a3d63db3dd1b7fd4f38469552b9eb7b55d4bea65276b326d36f6b34cb8c17",
      "text": "A hidden index is excluded from query-plan selection. Hiding an existing index therefore tests workload behavior without that access path while preserving a reversible alternative to dropping and rebuilding the index. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-hidden.md",
      "also": [
        "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/method/db.collection.hideIndex.md",
        "https://www.percona.com/blog/new-in-mongodb-4-4-hidden-index/",
        "https://studio3t.com/knowledge-base/3t-build/desktop-ide/mongodb-index-strategy/"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:ed8fa365ce8ed53a451f1cd5700ca5da6c5ecff87249f377ba3d39af8386470c"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:497dee76e8e3bdff5cc8bc3dbf4151e1c8e3a89249f34704e408e8d360ddff4e",
      "text": "Hidden indexes remain updated by collection writes and consume disk space and memory. A hide trial evaluates plan selection; it does not measure the write-performance or storage savings of actually removing the index. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-hidden.md",
      "also": [
        "https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/DRIVERS-816",
        "https://studio3t.com/knowledge-base/3t-build/desktop-ide/mongodb-index-strategy/"
      ],
      "validation_status": "NOT-SAMPLED",
      "evidence_ids": []
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:6fd088677a7d4a47e94ac8ebee6e1b833869b79fc2112aed4daa2d37a3b5fe4e",
      "text": "Choose an observation window that includes infrequent workloads. A 2024 practitioner thread described jobs that used candidate indexes only once every three months, illustrating why a short quiet trial can miss a dependency. (low confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/community/forums/t/hiding-index-replication-ops-manager/270730",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:f6910faaa2f39ea2cff7689d1b4da3dc34746e27170b491125729acc2fa15a0d"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:32fac56384781009b66ba8b8369e3ab2d178d1738030fe53ab489c6218cfe56a",
      "text": "As a concrete tooling example, mdbkit prints reversible hideIndex commands for index candidates and warns that an index used monthly can look unused after a week of observation. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-30)",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/saqibameen86/mdbkit",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:2010c14cbb5ce7432128bdbebeb83c9dd55104f7d4645d80d9c45772c14aff16",
        "ev:5d5f4a3ad01bff8b6425f032557db5a39b80db484afac6e2c605d3b3a833e752"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:3479a222a0bc48d259745833a9842820b450a7f16297eb3df9a04197d97bc875",
      "text": "Before hiding, compare query behavior with the index available; then hide it and compare query performance and plans. If performance regresses, unhide it. This is a reversible experiment that can still expose the application to degraded query performance during the trial. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-hidden.md",
      "also": [
        "https://www.percona.com/blog/new-in-mongodb-4-4-hidden-index/",
        "https://studio3t.com/knowledge-base/3t-build/desktop-ide/mongodb-index-strategy/"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:0d5e3bd3c4070b8a0183939ba680645c5d836cc1eb43e45e2f91656b1d6dc50a",
        "ev:ed8fa365ce8ed53a451f1cd5700ca5da6c5ecff87249f377ba3d39af8386470c"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:762803822133bab75ca1969b8bf9ec674836914e4bf1cc318faa0c6d0a3a2747",
      "text": "Changing an index from visible to hidden resets its $indexStats. Capture usage evidence before starting the trial; do not treat post-hide statistics as an uninterrupted historical baseline. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-hidden.md",
      "also": [
        "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/method/db.collection.hideIndex.md"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:09631caf9b0ac3306ac913de2f83e3d79d71241e7271c8000f871a9566f9f762"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:35d8b0c80e8313e9b5019074a793c08830a2468c9bd67309607187f3d2df685c",
      "text": "MongoDB does not allow hiding the _id index. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-hidden.md",
      "also": [
        "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/method/db.collection.hideIndex.md",
        "https://www.percona.com/blog/new-in-mongodb-4-4-hidden-index/"
      ],
      "validation_status": "NOT-SAMPLED",
      "evidence_ids": []
    }
  ],
